function pfOrigin(r){if(r.dismissed&&r.dismissed.origin)return r.dismissed.origin;if(r.classification&&r.classification!=='archive')return 'manage';if(r.selection&&r.selection.decision==='advance')return 'assess';return 'identify'}
function lastReviewDate(){var rc=data.reviewCadence||{};if(!rc.firstReviewDate)return null;var per={weekly:7,biweekly:14,monthly:30,quarterly:90}[rc.reviewFrequency]||14;var fp=new Date(rc.firstReviewDate).getTime();if(isNaN(fp)||fp>Date.now())return null;var n=Math.floor((Date.now()-fp)/(per*86400000));return new Date(fp+n*per*86400000)}
function pfIsNew(r){var lp=lastReviewDate();if(!lp||!r.loggedAt)return false;var d=new Date(r.loggedAt);return !isNaN(d.getTime())&&d.getTime()>lp.getTime()}
function pfSetF(key,facet,vv){if(!UI.pfF)UI.pfF={};if(!UI.pfF[key])UI.pfF[key]={};UI.pfF[key][facet]=(UI.pfF[key][facet]===vv?null:vv);render()}
