    "The re-scan: At each review, you are prompted to reopen the risk discovery process and to scan for new risks. The scan follows a checklist of sources you configure here and is owned by a named person.",
    "The event triggers: A project approaching development, a new deployment, a vendor or model change, an incident — each tells you to reopen the same risk discovery process immediately, scoped to the event."
