/* addendum 188 (17 Aug 2026, Paul's ruling): the Architecture module's RACI graphics, ported onto the governance data model \u2014 colored letter chips, click-to-cycle cells, and the legend row. The activity inputs, the accountable-count warning, and the team rows above the matrix are unchanged. saveGovRaci stays in place pending a dead-code ruling. */
