h+='<p style="font-size:13px;color:var(--text-muted);line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 4px">Every AI system on your inventory should be tested, on a regular basis, against the standards responsible AI is judged by: that it works reliably, that it is safe and secure, that it treats people fairly, and that someone is accountable for it. This applies to every system, all the time. It does not depend on any particular risk being open on your register. Work each system through the three stages below.</p>';
