h+=apSection('Risk posture','How much risk the organization is prepared to absorb, in its own words and on its own settings.',apBlock('Which best describes your AI implementation approach?',IMPL[tol.implApproach]||'')+apStrip('Where does your organization sit on the innovation vs. security spectrum?',tol.innovVsSecurity,'Security-first','Innovation-first')+apStrip('What accuracy level is acceptable for AI-driven decisions?',tol.decisionAccuracy,'Must be near-perfect','Comfortable with error')+apStrip('How much system downtime is acceptable?',tol.downtimeTolerance,'Zero tolerance','Hours acceptable')+apStrip('What is your tolerance for algorithmic bias?',tol.biasTolerance,'Zero tolerance','Some bias acceptable')+apStrip('How willing is your organization to accept AI-driven changes to jobs and roles?',tol.jobImpact,'Very resistant','Fully willing')+apStrip('Comfort with AI making customer decisions without human review?',tol.customerAutonomy,'Always human review','Full AI autonomy'));
h+=apSection('Current controls','The protections that exist today \u2014 policies, oversight, incident response, and audit history \u2014 as described.',apBlock('Does your organization have an AI use policy?',ctrl.aiPolicy)+apBlock('What data governance or privacy policies are in place?',ctrl.dataPolicy)+apBlock('Who currently has oversight responsibility for AI systems?',ctrl.oversightRoles)+apBlock('What incident response procedures exist for AI failures?',ctrl.incidentResponse)+apBlock('Has your organization ever conducted a systematic audit of AI systems that touch the business?',ctrl.auditHistory)+apStrip('How well are existing policies understood and followed?',ctrl.policyAdherence,'Poorly understood','Well embedded')+apStrip('How effective is current AI oversight?',ctrl.oversightEffectiveness,'No oversight','Robust oversight')+apStrip('How regularly are AI systems reviewed?',ctrl.reviewFrequency,'Never','Regularly'));
